<div id="cta-button-overview">
  <component-banner-img/>
  <p>
    A CTA (call-to-action) button takes users to another URL destination — it
    is always rendered as a hyperlink rather than a
    <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>
    . Use it to draw attention to a single, primary action, such as navigating
    to a landing page or promotional destination.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because a CTA Button is always a link, the
    <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>
    tag is
    <strong>required</strong>
    with a valid HREF attribute.
  </p>
</div>
